Package: ai-limits-widget
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libfontconfig1, libx11-6, libxft2, libxrender1
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Marcio Emmanuel <Marcioemm@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Marcioemm/AI-Limits-Widget
Description: widget local para acompanhar limites de uso de IA
 Exibe os limites restantes do Codex, Claude Code e Gemini pelo AGY sem
 armazenar credenciais nem enviar dados para servidores deste projeto.
